{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MolienBalancedForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.MolienBalancedForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MolienSymmetrisingTrace","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumClosedForm","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QIntegerCanonical"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.molienWeight_eq_balanced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.molienWeight_eq_balanced","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L104-L117","doc":"**The balanced form of the Molien weight**:\n`M_μ(q²) = q^{−κ(μ)} / ∏_{x ∈ μ} [h(x)]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.molien_cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.molien_cell","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L72-L102","doc":"**One cell**: `(1 − q²)/(1 − q^{2h}) = q^{1−h} / [h]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.prod_zpow_eq_zpow_sum'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.prod_zpow_eq_zpow_sum'","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L65-L70","doc":"A product of integer powers of `q ≠ 0` is the power of the sum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_hook_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.sum_hook_eq","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L56-L63","doc":"**Hook sum in terms of `n(μ)` and `κ(μ)`**: `Σ_x h(x) = κ(μ) + 2 n(μ) + |μ|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.hook_cast_eq_hookZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.hook_cast_eq_hookZ","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L48-L54","doc":"The natural-number hook of a cell agrees with the integer hook `hookZ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.molienContentSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.molienContentSum","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/MolienBalancedForm.lean#L45-L46","doc":"The **content sum** `κ(μ) = Σ_{x ∈ μ} c(x)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}